. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jp1bkZ2-jkYQ7kNvwGYhvJ2&_nc_oc=Adq_d2XgvWDvfL0Thz37oZ6NYIArthmPZlWYUSf9OALaFTaMXaLfJxyAqNRAVClyETU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDa9lLPsTI2WsW038408cagChiWOITkec2U4yAkA2qUUA&oe=6A4CF8BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h0tj7cl2rLwQ7kNvwGVUv6D&_nc_oc=AdqhPS0uz73xc4Hu1NCbIR7wAgftAg0EAnZl9TF557VfLBh6Gjc2LDamUDicpQ_RmEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDJMAYNWmmQ-frLbOlNxkMbJthZW9_YvABrQLjruJRAug&oe=6A4D0F5E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5fVBNjg_buYQ7kNvwHlrHYm&_nc_oc=Adq96Ut_ZDYuz32r8LAMm7vibcNdDGkvAlb28Wc8gJbOY-MOFJXQidEmn06e-h57TMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCyuMkpGPn7uekh_PBUzzCqcifN3ALGe9hnw9oWjGuEmg&oe=6A4D04DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco